WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:50.150
Someone once said...

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:56.520
There is a buffalo whose body is covered 
in rich, flavor-packed sauce yakisoba

00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:01.200
and lightly salted, 
lemon-flavored yakisoba...

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:06.130
The Yakisobuffalo!

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:13.270
There are perfect quality dorians from 
which pour out the ultimate lemonade...

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:18.410
The Lemonadorian!

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:22.480
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:27.920
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:34.430
Toriko took on a request from IGO President 
Ichiryu as part of his training.

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:39.170
He and Komatsu headed off to capture the 
king of vegetables, the Ozone Grass.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:44.600
As Toriko headed to his goal, the words 
of the president linger in his mind.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:48.570
Join together with a chef 
who can prepare ingredients

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:52.010
at the same level as yourself, 
and always travel together.

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:56.720
Toriko and Komatsu arrived 
at the vine of the Sky Plant,

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:59.420
and though a variety of 
beasts stood in their way,

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:01.350
they splendidly surpassed them all!

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:04.690
But near the top appears a monster cloud

00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:08.230
in which lightning runs 
wild... a cumulonimbus!

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:15.400
Discovery! The King of 
Vegetables, Ozone Grass!

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:27.350
That's a forbidden zone of 
the sky... A cumulonimbus!

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:31.480
Also known as a thunderhead.

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:34.020
At their largest, they can 
be 10,000 meters tall!

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:38.020
With torrential rain and lightning, 
it's definitely one monster cloud!

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:46.760
Near the cloud, the air is a turbulent storm.

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:49.470
We've gotta keep our head in the 
game, or we'll be blown away.

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:51.440
But it was sunny just before...

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:52.970
Why has it changed so suddenly?

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:55.810
The air above the ground became unstable

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:59.710
and caused a sudden updraft, which 
is what created the cumulonimbus.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:02.650
The quicker ones will take 
only a couple minutes to form.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:05.220
There it is... An Oxygen Leaf.

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:09.350
Komatsu, put this on.

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:10.790
Why?

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:12.320
It's an oxygen mask.

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:15.130
You won't be able to breathe 
normally from here on.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:16.590
And this will...?

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:19.200
It's a leaf from a rare Oxygen Tree.

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:22.500
Even with just a little bit of 
sunlight, it'll create oxygen.

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:26.470
It takes the carbon dioxide in your breath 
and converts it using photosynthesis.

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:31.010
It'll continue producing oxygen even 
after it's been picked for about a month.

00:04:31.010 --> 00:04:33.510
But... just a little bit of sunlight?

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:35.380
It's so dark, so where...?

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:37.580
The cloud is filled with lightning.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.450
That'll be plenty for photosynthesis.

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:41.880
Lightning?!

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:45.990
Are you okay without wearing 
a mask, Toriko-san?

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:48.020
You don't have to worry about me.

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.290
More importantly...

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:50.630
Here it comes!

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:59.000
A patch of -50 degree air that the 
cumulonimbus rams into the ground...

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:00.700
A down burst!

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:02.940
It's like a freezing bomb!

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:05.340
Toriko-san!

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:06.470
Shivering!

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:17.850
Shivering sure does drain my energy...

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:21.420
There's less than half as much oxygen 
here compared to the surface...

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:24.660
I have to be careful about 
draining my energy, or else...

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:27.800
You have to continue to train your body...

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:29.200
Or rather, train your cells

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:33.330
to adapt instantly to all kinds 
of different environments!

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.340
He's right.

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:46.050
I can't oppose the environment.

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:49.920
Follow it, yield to it, adapt to it...

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:53.490
Gotta try and keep as much oxygen 
in my lungs as possible...

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:56.020
Stabilize the oxygen content in my blood...

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.070
It's calmed down!

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:14.010
What is it now?!

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:15.010
Hail!

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:15.870
Knife!

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:20.610
That's way too big!

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:22.450
Hang on tight!

00:06:22.950 --> 00:06:24.550
We'll cut our way through!

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:33.890
That was close!

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:37.360
Toriko-san! Enough already!

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:40.170
It's too dangerous to go any further!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.300
We'll just be going to our deaths!

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:43.800
Calm down, Komatsu!

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:46.940
We're fighting nature 
here! It's not our enemy!

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:50.240
If we calm down and cope with it, 
we'll make it through, I promise!

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:53.610
And let me say this.

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:55.810
We didn't come here to die.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:59.150
We're on this journey to eat, and to live!

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:09.660
There's not much oxygen... Maybe 
I went a little too crazy there.

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:12.100
T-Toriko-san...?

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:14.230
Here.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:17.170
What... What are you doing?

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.740
You'll die!

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:24.040
But you're suffering too, Toriko-san...

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.210
Komatsu...

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:32.350
I told you, don't worry about me.

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:35.950
Leave it to me, Komatsu.

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:37.350
Believe in me!

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:38.390
Okay!

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:51.900
Here we go, Komatsu!

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:53.870
We're gonna break into the cumulonimbus!

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:54.800
Right!

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:09.720
It's so dark, I can't see well...

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:12.790
I can move forward only on smell alone!

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:35.410
That's more energy than I thought!

00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:40.550
This is bad...

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:41.880
I'm starting to lose consciousness...

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:46.850
Komatsu!

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:59.530
I believe in you, Toriko-san!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.470
Leave it me, Komatsu.

00:09:04.470 --> 00:09:08.710
You take it easy in this 
storm of air currents,

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.880
'cause you're riding on Toriko Air!

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:15.780
I can't just breathe normally.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.350
In this low oxygen environment,

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:19.790
I can't let any of the 
oxygen I breathe in escape.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:24.360
Stop the air from escaping in the 
upper part of the windpipe...

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.290
Bring in cold air into my mouth...

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:31.530
Freeze the component of air with the 
highest freezing point, carbon dioxide...

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:35.830
Discharge just the carbon dioxide, 
and suck in just the oxygen!

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:38.570
This is it! This is how to breathe!

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:41.940
Just like the old man said: Breath that 
doesn't turn white even when it's cold!

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:47.680
I can't really do it smoothly yet, but 
this way I can move my body freely!

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:55.350
The wind has died down?

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:57.060
W-Why?

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.400
This is...

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:11.400
The legendary thunderbird, said 
to live within thunderheads...

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:13.270
The Lightning Phoenix!

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:20.840
Sorry about this, but I hope 
you can spare a feather!

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:27.780
Wow...

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:31.460
It's strange... The wind 
didn't get anywhere near it.

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:40.360
This Lightning Phoenix feather 
works just like I thought!

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:53.040
The sky is getting brighter!

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:55.380
We're getting close to the top of the cloud!

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:01.820
Almost there!

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:03.220
We're almost there!

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.960
We're out!

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:11.160
S-So bright!

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.600
Komatsu, look!

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:03.010
This is where the vegetable garden 
of the heavens is... Vegetable Sky!

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:09.020
Look at this, Komatsu.

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:10.950
I can't believe this!

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:13.720
The grass is putting down roots in the cloud!

00:12:15.220 --> 00:12:18.120
It smells like deep, rich soil...

00:12:18.390 --> 00:12:19.460
Let's try standing on it!

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:22.100
A-Are you sure?

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:29.140
Wow! I'm standing on a cloud!

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:31.000
You try it too, Komatsu!

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:34.970
What's the matter?

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:37.310
Knees still shaking in fear?

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:41.050
Well, we had to get through that cloud.

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:44.680
I'm not going to forget something 
that scary so easily.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:46.520
You've gotten super old!

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:48.020
I have?

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:50.020
You look like an old man!

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:51.560
You even get up like one!

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:57.200
It's true... My life kept flashing before 
my eyes again and again and again...

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:59.730
The last one, I even saw a previous life...

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:01.030
A previous life flashed before your eyes?

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:02.400
Damn, you must have been scared!

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:04.870
Wait, whaddaya mean "previous life"?!

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:10.810
Although, I faintly remember 
hearing your words, Toriko-san.

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:14.810
And I recall they really calmed me down.

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:18.980
You take it easy, 'cause 
you're riding on Toriko Air!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:21.750
Thank you very much, Toriko-san.

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:24.120
I'm the one who should be thanking you.

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:27.560
It was dangerous for me 
in that cumulonimbus, too.

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:33.760
The reason I found that way of breathing 
was because you believed in me.

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:42.840
What is it, Toriko-san?

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:47.140
I get it now... I can smell volcanic ash.

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:50.410
This cloud has a large amount 
of volcanic ash in it

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:52.320
from volcanoes on the surface.

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:56.120
You could say that the ash collected 
together to form this cloud.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:14:00.960
This grass grows by sucking up 
the minerals in the ash, then.

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:02.660
I see.

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:05.500
The cloud must have a lot 
of minerals from the ash

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:07.500
for there to be all this grass.

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:10.370
There are a lot of active volcanoes 
on the surface around here.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:12.940
And I think the Wool Volcano is nearby, too.

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:16.670
The ash from the Wool Volcano 
is chock full of minerals.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:22.080
Oh yeah... Ever since we got here, I've 
been fine without the oxygen mask.

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:24.310
That's because there's so much greenery.

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:26.650
They're creating oxygen through 
photosynthesis, you know?

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:27.880
I see!

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:30.590
And now that we've entered the stratosphere,

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:33.660
the wind currents have died 
down and it feels a bit warmer.

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:36.490
It's nice to warm up...

00:14:36.490 --> 00:14:39.360
It is definitely a sky paradise!

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:55.740
Look here! There's a worm!

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:58.550
Oh! That's a Mineral Worm!

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:02.650
The little master of the fields, 
that only shows up in fertile soil!

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:05.550
If this guy's here, then we're close!

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:07.390
Vegetable Sky!

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:11.290
T-This smell! Over that way!

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:12.630
Toriko-san!

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:32.750
W-What in the world...!

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:36.450
As far as my eyes can see...

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:38.750
A vegetable carpet!

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:43.090
This is the vegetable 
garden in the heavens...

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:47.390
Vegetable Sky!

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:52.430
This is the smell of vegetables?!

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:57.100
It smells just as strong, deep, 
and rich as grilled meat or fish!

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:59.340
And it doesn't smell like raw plants at all!

00:15:59.340 --> 00:16:02.670
It smells fresh, crisp, and refreshing!

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:05.910
What weight!

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:10.420
I've never seen a daikon with so 
much heavy fiber and water content!

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:12.650
Knife!

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:21.060
I give thanks to all this 
world's great bounty...

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:23.130
Let's eat!

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:28.230
Delicious!

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:30.940
I can't believe how fresh it is!

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:34.110
It's like a clear mountain 
stream gushing out in my mouth,

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:36.270
spreading through my body!

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:46.920
And then afterwards comes the 
deep flavor of oden soup broth...

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:50.420
And no matter how many times 
I chew, it's still crunchy!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:53.420
I had no idea there were daikons like this!

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:54.660
Hey, Komatsu!

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:56.560
Yes, Toriko-san!

00:16:57.130 --> 00:16:59.030
Your face is sparkling!

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:01.360
And you were an old fart just a second ago!

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:02.030
What happened?

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:05.940
It's because I ate this fresh cucumber!

00:17:05.940 --> 00:17:08.670
Your skin became that shiny?

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:10.340
That's pretty damn fresh, I'd say.

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:12.810
This cucumber is amazing!

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:19.220
Even without any seasoning, a perfectly 
salty taste expands inside my mouth!

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:23.690
And the crispy texture is 
something I'm getting hooked on!

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:24.990
Alright, Komatsu!

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:27.120
Let's try the other vegetables!

00:17:27.120 --> 00:17:27.920
Right!

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:34.200
Amazing! There's a ton 
of Marshmallow Pumpkins!

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:36.330
I've never seen these before!

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:39.130
How cute...

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:43.070
Yum!

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:46.910
They're all fluffy and melt in your mouth...

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:48.880
How rich and sweet!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:51.580
It tastes like there's honey mixed in...

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:54.580
Ooh! A Broccotree!

00:17:54.580 --> 00:17:57.290
Wow! It's a broccoli tree, right?

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:05.590
So soft... A gentle texture!

00:18:05.590 --> 00:18:07.560
It's like it's been boiled!

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:12.300
Wow! Thousand Island dressing is gushing out!

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:18.410
I can't stop after just one bite!

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:23.840
It's a Potato Spring!

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:25.110
Wow!

00:18:25.110 --> 00:18:27.680
Are those all fried potatoes?

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:32.920
Right out of the fryer! Piping hot!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.990
They smell wonderful.

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:43.800
Yum! The natural salt flavor hits the spot!

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:48.970
These ultimate fried potatoes are the best!

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:51.740
I can't get enough of this giant leek!

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:54.540
Even raw, it's not bitter at all!

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:57.510
The more I chew, the sweeter it tastes!

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:04.450
This tomato is super fruity!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:10.290
'Cause it's a fruit, that's why!

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:22.830
Man, we sure ate.

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:26.410
I'm so full, and so satisfied!

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:28.610
Um, Toriko-san...

00:19:29.470 --> 00:19:33.650
I felt something while I was eating.

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:39.580
That's some fast digestion!

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:42.390
The sky vegetables are just too nutritious!

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:45.020
They digest way too smoothly and quickly!

00:19:45.020 --> 00:19:46.760
W-What'll we do?

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:48.460
What'll we do?

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:50.060
What else?

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:56.530
I can't believe I'm gonna do 
this in the sky paradise...

00:19:56.530 --> 00:20:00.500
It's stuff we ate here, so 
it might be good fertilizer!

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:10.380
Much better!

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:13.720
All the waste in my body came right out!

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:37.470
T-That's...

00:20:40.810 --> 00:20:43.710
Ozone... Grass?!

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:47.280
Toriko-san!

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:49.050
Toriko-san!

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.920
I found it!

00:20:52.320 --> 00:20:54.660
Toriko-san!

00:21:10.510 --> 00:21:12.070
Sabrina

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:15.310
Pa-pa-pa-para

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:17.150
Sabrina

00:21:19.110 --> 00:21:26.250
Rainy day, danced down on the night city

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:33.130
You had deep red lipstick on you

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:36.900
Like you were toyed with

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:40.370
Like you were tasted

00:21:40.370 --> 00:21:47.440
A solitary silhouette seen through the glass

00:21:47.440 --> 00:21:54.210
One day, one day... Search for true love

00:21:54.210 --> 00:22:01.250
Even if hurt by the lies going around town

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:06.030
Rottening fruit

00:22:06.030 --> 00:22:07.560
Sabrina

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:13.430
Gourmet News!

00:22:14.570 --> 00:22:16.100
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:18.500
The potatoes in the Vegetable Sky

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:22.940
taste like sweet potatoes after 
you bake them for just a bit...

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:25.140
And today I'm gonna introduce to you

00:22:25.140 --> 00:22:28.180
a simple way to experience 
that taste for yourself!

00:22:28.380 --> 00:22:33.650
Spread butter on azuki-bean jelly, 
and it'll taste like a sweet potato!

00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:39.220
Yes! A heaping helping of deliciousness!

00:22:39.220 --> 00:22:41.530
It's a sweet potato!

00:22:41.530 --> 00:22:45.560
Don't pig out too much, 
or you'll regret it tater!

00:22:45.930 --> 00:22:48.430
Or you'll regret it tater...

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:50.500
Regret it tater...

00:22:51.540 --> 00:22:52.400
Tater...

00:22:53.470 --> 00:22:56.340
Taro you what, I'm gonna yam it up!

00:22:56.340 --> 00:22:57.410
Yam it up!

00:22:57.410 --> 00:22:58.840
Yam it up!

00:23:01.510 --> 00:23:04.420
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:07.310 --> 00:23:09.290
The special cooking ingredient, Ozone Grass.

00:23:09.690 --> 00:23:13.660
To sample it's heavenly taste, their friendship will be tested.

